<mxCell id="evolve" value="Evolve: three Coders try the job, each their own way. The project's&#xa;Measure command scores each copy (0 to 100); the best goes on. With&#xa;a Target and a loop it is tried again while the best is below it." style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#1a1a1a;fontSize=15;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="500" y="690" width="650" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
